## Positioning

The Data suite is where numbers become a picture, and it is the one suite that spans two packages. **Visualization** (SparkChart, AllocationBar, DiffTable, SignalMeter) are compact, in-line data displays that ship inside the main package and import through the `@talex-touch/tuffex/pro` entry. **Charts** is the standalone `@talex-touch/tuffex-charts` package — a kumo-shaped API over Vue-rendered SVG, with no echarts dependency — installed separately from the main package. Start from the [Charts overview](./charts.en.mdc) for the chart family, and reach for a Visualization component when a full chart would be too much for the space you have.

